+
+Wasmer detects the Astro site, runs `bun install --no-save` and `bun run build`, and serves the generated `dist` folder as static files. The button imports and builds this public repository as-is; it does not fork it. To customize the site and redeploy on every push, fork this repository and import your own repository on Wasmer.
